type: software
title: "Object Segmentation Sweep"
abstract: >-
  ImageJ/Fiji plugin for reviewing classical segmentation settings across one
  or two parameter axes and reporting independent object-count-knee and
  neighbour-IoU-stability recommendations with crop and range provenance.
